1
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,230
Ross, when's this comet thing start?
羅斯，這個彗星的事 到底什麼時候開始？

2
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:11,270
Well, technically, it started 7 billion years ago.
理論上來說，七百萬年前

3
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:14,880
Okay. Fine, I'll stop. No teaching, okay?
好，我不講課，好嗎？

4
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:18,910
We'll just watch the pretty light streaking across the sky.
我們只欣賞美麗的流光劃過天空

5
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,580
Okay?
好嗎？

6
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:25,450
Whose official name is Bapstein-King. Okay! Okay!
它的正式名字 是巴布斯坦王，好！好！

7
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:30,460
There it is. Oh, look at that!
在那兒，你看！

8
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:33,590
Isn't Mother Nature amazing?
大自然真是神奇

9
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:37,120
That's a plane.
那是一台飛機

10
00:00:38,130 --> 00:00:41,970
Well, all right, 1700 bags of peanuts flying that high...
好吧，1700袋的花生 飛在那麼高的地方…

11
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,970
that's pretty amazing too.
也是很神奇

12
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:49,800
-I wonder if you can see my apartment. -No, you can't.
-我在想能不能看到我家 -不能，看不到

13
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:53,570
-What? -I don't know.
-什麼？ -我不知道

14
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,580
Man, look at all those stars.
看看這些星星

15
00:00:57,790 --> 00:01:02,950
Infinite space. It really makes you wonder, doesn't it?
無涯的天空，讓你有無盡遐思，是不？

16
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:05,560
-Know what else makes you wonder? -What?
-知道還有什麼讓你有無盡遐思？ -什麼？

17
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:08,350
Check out the rack on that chick.
看看那個妞的胸部

18
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:14,590
The One Where They're Up All Night
本集播出：六人行夜未眠

00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:16,590
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

19
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:55,940
We've been out here for two hours...
我們已經在外面兩個小時了…

20
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:59,440
and we haven't seen any stupid comets. Can we go now?
還沒看到笨彗星，我們可以走了嗎？

21
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:02,950
I mean, Chandler's getting chilly.
我是說，錢德冷死了

22
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:08,190
No, I'm not.
不，我沒有

23
00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:11,990
Then why are you wearing Monica's jacket?
那你為什麼穿著摩妮卡的夾克？

24
00:02:12,890 --> 00:02:15,450
Because it's flattering!
因為好看！

25
00:02:16,930 --> 00:02:19,230
Come on, Monica. Come on, Monica.
走吧，摩妮卡，走吧，摩妮卡

26
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:23,800
-We're going too. We got a movie. -I won't say no to a movie.
-我們也要走了，租了電影看 -我從不錯過看電影

27
00:02:24,070 --> 00:02:26,840
Oh, Phoebe, we just actually wanted to be alone.
菲比，其實我們想獨處

28
00:02:27,010 --> 00:02:29,170
-Sh. Get me out of here. -Oh, okay.
-帶我一起走 -哦，好

29
00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:34,040
-Hey, Ross. -What?
-嘿，羅斯 -怎樣？

30
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,940
-Check it out. -Is it the comet?
-你看看 -那是彗星嗎？

31
00:02:36,550 --> 00:02:40,250
No. Look, there's a bug stuck in tar right here.
不，那是只被焦油黏住的蟲

32
00:02:41,490 --> 00:02:42,510
I can't believe..
我不能相信…

33
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:45,250
I bring you to see the Bapstein-King comet...
我帶你來看巴布斯坦王彗星…

34
00:02:45,460 --> 00:02:47,990
one of nature's most spectacular phenomena...
大自然最壯觀的現象之一…

35
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:52,760
and all you care about are bugs stuck in tar and some woman.
而你只關心被焦油黏住的蟲 和一個女人

36
00:02:55,670 --> 00:02:58,330
You know, there's two women, dude.
你知道，有兩個女人，老兄

37
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,270
Show me where.
在哪裡

38
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,180
Okay. Right up here.
好，在那裡

39
00:03:10,150 --> 00:03:13,380
Joey, where's the pipe that was holding the door open?
喬伊，我們拿來頂住門的管子呢？

40
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:14,850
I don't know.
我不知道

41
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:25,060
Yeah, I do.
哦，我知道

42
00:03:27,870 --> 00:03:29,890
-Joey! -What? Hey, don't look at me!
-喬伊！ -怎樣？嘿，別看著我！

43
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:34,870
You wanted to come up here and look for some stupid Burger King comet.
是你要上來看什麼笨漢堡王彗星的

44
00:03:35,940 --> 00:03:38,940
It's called the Bapstein-King comet, okay?
它叫做巴布斯坦王彗星，好嗎？

45
00:03:39,210 --> 00:03:42,670
Hey, Bapstein was a very well-respected astronomer from..
嘿，巴布斯坦是一位 很受尊敬的太空人，由…

46
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:44,520
No!
不！

47
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:57,830
-Monica. -She's sleeping.
-摩妮卡 -她在睡覺

48
00:04:00,540 --> 00:04:02,900
I know. Just a quick question.
我知道，很快問一個問題

49
00:04:03,140 --> 00:04:07,440
Which one was Deep Impact and which one was Armageddon?
那一部是《彗星撞地球》 那一部是《世界末日》？

50
00:04:10,210 --> 00:04:13,080
Deep Impact was the one with Robert Duvall.
《彗星撞地球》是有勞勃杜瓦那部

51
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:16,940
Armageddon is what's going to happen to you if you wake me up.
《世界末日》是如果你叫醒我 會發生在你身上的

52
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:21,210
Sorry, I just can't sleep.
抱歉，我睡不著

53
00:04:26,190 --> 00:04:30,360
Where's that book you're reading with two women who are ice-skating...
你在看的那本書在哪兒？ 有兩個女人在溜冰…

54
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:33,120
and wearing those hats with the flowers on it.
戴著有花的帽子的

55
00:04:33,330 --> 00:04:36,430
Because every time I look at that cover, I'm like..
每次我一看到它的封面，我就…

56
00:04:38,770 --> 00:04:41,800
It's in the living room,  where there's also a light...
在客廳，那兒有燈…

57
00:04:42,010 --> 00:04:44,170
and no one will kick you in the shin.
而且沒有人會踢你小腿

58
00:04:45,850 --> 00:04:47,080
What?
什麼？

59
00:04:59,460 --> 00:05:02,690
Please don't be a spaceship. Please don't be a spaceship.
拜託不要是太空船 拜託不要是太空船

60
00:05:10,610 --> 00:05:12,300
Oh, thank God.
感謝上帝

61
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:49,210
How could you be beeping? I just disconnected you!
你怎麼可能還在？我把你斷電了！

62
00:05:49,410 --> 00:05:53,570
I took out your battery! How can..? Don't interrupt me!
我拿掉了你的電池！ 怎麼還能…？不要打斷我說話！

63
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:57,780
Monica! Monica!
瑞秋！摩妮卡！

64
00:05:58,050 --> 00:05:59,640
Come on!
真是的！

65
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:04,750
I can't believe this!
真受不了！

66
00:06:05,030 --> 00:06:09,220
All right, well, I guess we know what we have to do to get down.
好吧，我想我們知道 要怎麼做才能下去

67
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,560
Yeah, I guess we don't have a choice.
是啊，我想我們沒有選擇

68
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:15,670
Help us! Please, help us!
救命！救救我們！

69
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:20,070
We're stuck up on the roof, and we can't get down!
我們被困在屋頂，下不去！

70
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:22,940
Ross.
羅斯

71
00:06:24,380 --> 00:06:27,140
I was thinking we'd just go down the fire escape.
我是在想用逃生梯下去

72
00:06:28,950 --> 00:06:31,010
I know. I wasn't finished.
我知道，我還沒說完

73
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:36,290
But don't worry!
但是不用擔心！

74
00:06:36,890 --> 00:06:40,450
We're gonna go down the fire escape!
我們會用逃生梯下去！

75
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,540
Sh!

76
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:59,880
I'm sorry, I thought I'd make some warm milk and it would help me sleep.
抱歉，我想熱點牛奶來幫助睡眠

77
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,410
With a wok?
用炒菜鍋？

78
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:05,810
My boring book didn't put you to sleep?
我以為你要看我的書來幫助睡覺？

79
00:07:06,050 --> 00:07:08,420
It got interesting.
它後來變得很有意思

80
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:10,720
Damn you, Oprah!
可惡的歐普拉！

81
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:14,730
Here, let me make the milk. I'm up anyway.
這兒，我來替你熱牛奶 反正我已經起來了

82
00:07:14,930 --> 00:07:17,420
You know what we could do now that we're up?
既然我們已經起來了 你知道可以做什麼嗎？

83
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:20,400
We could just talk to each other all night long.
我們可以促膝長談

84
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:23,090
Like when we were first dating. It'd be fun.
像我們剛開始約會時那樣 會很好玩的

85
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:25,030
-Okay, that does sound fun. -Yeah.
-好，聽來是很有意思 -是啊

86
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:28,730
So how bummed were you when the second sister died, huh?
第二個妹妹死的時候 你是不是很生氣？

87
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,880
The second sister dies?!
第二個妹妹死了？！

88
00:07:35,850 --> 00:07:37,220
No.
沒有

89
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:42,060
No, I was talking about the book I was reading.
沒有，我是在說我在看的那本書

90
00:07:42,260 --> 00:07:46,350
The second sister dies in Archie and Jughead Double Digest?
《阿契漫劃合集》裡第二個妹妹死了？

91
00:07:48,530 --> 00:07:49,690
That's correct.
對

92
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:59,270
Want to go in the bedroom? It's more comfortable.
要不要進臥房去？比較舒服一點

93
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:01,200
-Sure. -Okay.
-當然 -好

94
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:06,080
Oh, wait, did you send those contracts to Milan?
等一下，你有沒有把合約寄去米蘭？

95
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:09,940
If this is your idea of sexy talk...
你覺得這是性感的談話…

96
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:13,480
Did you overnight the contracts I gave you?
你有沒有快遞寄出我拿給你的合約？

97
00:08:13,650 --> 00:08:14,640
What contracts?
什麼合約？

98
00:08:14,820 --> 00:08:18,690
Please tell me this is just one of your jokes that I don't get.
拜託，告訴我這是 你另一個我搞不懂的笑話

99
00:08:18,890 --> 00:08:20,020
Like what?
像什麼？

100
00:08:20,190 --> 00:08:23,250
Like the thing when you put the phone in your pants?
像是你把電話放在褲襠？

101
00:08:25,030 --> 00:08:27,260
Tag, I'm serious. This isn't funny.
泰格，我很認真，這不好笑

102
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:30,060
Those contracts had to go out today.
那些合約今天一定要寄出去

103
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:32,260
You didn't give me any contracts.
你沒給我什麼合約

104
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:35,570
Yes, I did. I put a little Post-it on it that said:
有，我有，我還貼了 一張隨手貼，寫著：

105
00:08:35,780 --> 00:08:39,640
"Must go out today, " and I underlined "today" three times.
「今天一定要寄出」 在「今天」下面劃了三道

106
00:08:39,850 --> 00:08:44,340
Then I put a little heart in the corner so I wouldn't seem too bossy.
然後我還在角落劃了一顆心 因為我不想太像上司

107
00:08:44,850 --> 00:08:46,680
You never gave them to me.
你沒有給我

108
00:08:46,890 --> 00:08:51,590
If we went to the office, you would see those contracts sitting on your desk.
如果我們到辦公室去 你會看到它在你的辦公桌上

109
00:08:51,790 --> 00:08:55,850
No, I'd see you looking embarrassed because they are not on my desk.
不，我會看到你很窘 因為它不在我的辦公桌上

110
00:08:56,060 --> 00:09:00,760
Maybe I'm embarrassed because you talk on the phone with your crotch.
也許我很窘，是因為你用褲襠接電話

111
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:03,860
You want to go to the office now?
你要現在去辦公室？

112
00:09:04,070 --> 00:09:07,270
Come on, it's late. We're not going down to the office.
算了，很晚了，我們不要到辦公室去

113
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:11,280
Yeah, I understand. I wouldn't want to be proved wrong either.
是，我瞭解，我也不會想 被證明是錯的

114
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:13,740
All right, get your coat!
好，拿外套！

115
00:09:14,950 --> 00:09:18,980
Oh! When did you unhook this? Nice work!
你什麼時候解開的？好厲害！

116
00:09:27,130 --> 00:09:30,000
It won't go down any further. It's stuck.
不能再下去了，卡住了

117
00:09:31,100 --> 00:09:32,730
We'll just have to jump.
我們只有跳下去

118
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:37,300
Now, we're gonna have to make sure to land...
我們一定要確定著陸在…

119
00:09:37,570 --> 00:09:40,910
to the right of that patch of ice, okay?
那塊冰的右邊，好嗎？

120
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:44,810
Not hit the dumpster on the other side.
不要撞到旁邊的垃圾桶

121
00:09:45,450 --> 00:09:50,850
And try to avoid that weird brownish-red stuff in the middle.
試著避開中間那棕紅色的奇怪東西

122
00:09:52,090 --> 00:09:54,610
So when you get down there...
當你下到下面以後…

123
00:09:56,590 --> 00:10:01,490
you go up to the roof and you let me in.
你到屋頂讓我進去

124
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:05,090
-Wait a minute. I have to do it? -You'll be fine.
-等一下，要我去？ -你會沒事的

125
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:07,960
It'll be just like bungee jumping, you know?
就像高空彈跳

126
00:10:08,170 --> 00:10:12,330
But instead of bouncing back up,  you won't.
但你不會回彈

127
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:17,780
Well, what if I smack my head on the concrete?
要是我的頭撞到水泥呢？

128
00:10:17,980 --> 00:10:21,510
Well, I'm not gonna lie to you, Joey. It's a possibility.
喬伊，我不想騙你，是有這個可能的

129
00:10:24,650 --> 00:10:28,140
I don't know. Tell you what,  let's flip to see who does it.
我不知道，這樣吧，擲銅板決定誰去

130
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:31,330
-You call it in the air, all right? -Oh, all right.
-在空中時說出你要的那一面，好吧？ -好吧

131
00:10:35,530 --> 00:10:38,860
-Can you see what it is? -No.
-你看得到是那一面嗎？ -不行

132
00:10:39,070 --> 00:10:42,370
-Okay. Well, you be careful. -No, Ross, stop it.
-你小心一點 -羅斯，不要這樣

133
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,700
I'm not jumping.
我不跳

134
00:10:43,900 --> 00:10:48,030
Look, I have an audition tomorrow, and I can't go if I break my leg.
明天我要試鏡 如果摔斷腿就不能去了

135
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:52,840
Well, I'm not jumping. I have a son. He won't have a father if I die.
我不跳，我有一個兒子 要是我死了他就沒爸爸了

136
00:10:53,050 --> 00:10:54,950
So it looks like we're even.
看來我們平手

137
00:11:00,250 --> 00:11:02,980
Okay, so this wire...
好，這條線…

138
00:11:03,290 --> 00:11:07,160
is connected to this wire, which plugs into here.
接到這條線，插到這兒

139
00:11:07,830 --> 00:11:11,960
Okay, so to get the beeping to stop, all I have to do...
好，讓嗶聲停止，我只要…

140
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:14,660
Okay.

141
00:11:23,510 --> 00:11:25,310
Well done, Phoebe.
做得好，菲比

142
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:33,010
What do you want from me?!
你要我怎麼樣？！

143
00:11:36,990 --> 00:11:39,590
Here's your milk. What should we talk about?
你的牛奶來了，你想談什麼？

144
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:44,430
What? What? What?
什麼？什麼？什麼？

145
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:49,090
Oh, were you sleeping, sweetie? I'm sorry. Here.
甜心，你在睡覺嗎？抱歉，這兒

146
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,970
Okay. Feel free to look...
好，你愛怎麼找都行…

147
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:59,080
but I'm telling you those contracts are not here.
不過我告訴你 那些合約沒在這張桌上

148
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:01,870
How could you know? Look at this mess, Tag.
你怎麼可能知道？ 你看看有多亂，泰格

149
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:05,250
This is what I'm saying. You have to be more organized.
這就是我說的，你一定要有組織一點

150
00:12:05,450 --> 00:12:09,410
You've got newspapers, you've got magazines, you.. Oh!
有報紙，有雜誌，你…喔！

151
00:12:09,890 --> 00:12:12,360
And who's this chippy?
這小妞是誰？

152
00:12:13,060 --> 00:12:15,320
A little young for you, but whatever.
對你來說太幼齒一點，隨便啦

153
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:16,660
That's my sister.
是我妹

154
00:12:17,670 --> 00:12:20,500
Really? Very cute braces.
真的？牙套好可愛

155
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:24,600
Anyway, you know what? The point is, Tag, start looking...
你知道嗎？重點是 泰格，開始找吧…

156
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:28,070
because you're gonna find those contracts on your desk.
你會在你桌上找到那些合約

157
00:12:29,910 --> 00:12:33,710
So when do you imagine you gave them to me? Morning or afternoon?
你想像是什麼時候給我的？ 早上還是下午？

158
00:12:33,910 --> 00:12:38,080
In the afternoon. Mr. Zelner came into my office after lunch...
下午，顏先生午餐後 進來我辦公室…

159
00:12:38,290 --> 00:12:41,740
he put them on my desk,  and then I put a Post-it on it...
他把它放在我桌上 我貼了一張隨手貼在上面…

160
00:12:43,790 --> 00:12:44,850
that said:
寫著：

161
00:12:45,590 --> 00:12:48,080
"Must go out today."
「今天一定要寄出」

162
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:52,930
So you just keep looking in there, all right?
請你繼續找，好嗎？

163
00:13:00,140 --> 00:13:01,510
They're not here.
不在這裡

164
00:13:02,780 --> 00:13:04,210
Puzzler.
奇怪奇怪

165
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:09,410
Bit of a puzzle.
真奇怪

166
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:13,650
Why don't you check the copy room? Maybe the contracts are in there.
你去影印室找一找，也許你放在那兒

167
00:13:13,850 --> 00:13:16,720
-How could I have left them there? -I don't know.
-我怎麼可能放在那兒？ -我不知道

168
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:19,390
How can your genitals make phone calls?
你的私處怎麼可能打電話？

169
00:13:20,530 --> 00:13:23,900
Okay? It's not a perfect world. Just go, please?
好嗎？這不是個完美的世界 請你去找一找

170
00:13:24,830 --> 00:13:26,730
-Fine. -Thank you.
-好吧 -謝謝

171
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:41,540
Hello?
喂？

172
00:13:45,890 --> 00:13:47,220
I still don't get it.
我還是不懂

173
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:53,620
You still awake?
你還醒著嗎？

174
00:13:54,060 --> 00:13:55,860
Yeah. You?
是啊，你呢？

175
00:13:56,930 --> 00:13:59,900
You do know that was me that just said that, right?
你知道說話的是我吧？

176
00:14:04,070 --> 00:14:05,370
Hey.
嘿

177
00:14:05,610 --> 00:14:07,400
As long as we're both up...
既然我們都醒著…

178
00:14:08,710 --> 00:14:10,070
Yeah?
怎樣？

179
00:14:12,610 --> 00:14:16,240
I hope you're not thinking about cleaning the living room.
我希望你不是想要打掃客廳

180
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:24,490
Man, I'm starving. What the hell was I thinking at dinner?
我餓死了，晚飯時我在想什麼啊？

181
00:14:24,730 --> 00:14:28,250
"Do you want soup or salad?" Both, always order both.
「你要湯還是沙拉？」 兩樣都要，永遠都兩樣都要

182
00:14:30,430 --> 00:14:34,600
You know, I'm looking,  and I don't think anyone's home here.
我看了半天，我想沒人在家

183
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:37,460
I say we just break the window...
我說我們打破窗戶…

184
00:14:37,670 --> 00:14:38,930
crawl through...
爬進去…

185
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,510
and you know, explain later.
之後再解釋

186
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:43,610
-No one's home? -I don't think so.
-沒人在家？ -我想沒有

187
00:14:43,810 --> 00:14:44,940
Hello?
喂？

188
00:14:51,650 --> 00:14:54,520
So when you get in there...
當你進去之後…

189
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:05,790
Okay. This is where you and I part ways.
你我該在這裡分手了

190
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,260
Noisy bitch!
吵死人的賤貨！

191
00:15:12,110 --> 00:15:14,800
Oh, what? What are you doing?
怎麼？你在幹什麼？

192
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:17,470
Do you know what just happened?
你知道剛剛發生什麼事嗎？

193
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:22,480
Yeah. We had sex and then we fell asleep.
是啊，我們做愛，然後睡著了

194
00:15:24,450 --> 00:15:27,910
No. We were in the middle of sex...
不，我們做了一半…

195
00:15:28,660 --> 00:15:31,220
and you fell asleep.
然後你睡著了

196
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:35,660
No. No, that's not true.
不，不，沒有這回事

197
00:15:35,930 --> 00:15:38,130
No, best time ever.
不，這是最棒的一次

198
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:42,700
Yeah. You rock my world.
你震撼了我的世界

199
00:15:45,510 --> 00:15:47,500
-Monica? -What?
-摩妮卡？ -怎麼？

200
00:15:47,710 --> 00:15:51,300
I was giving you some of my best moves, and you missed it.
這是我表現最好的時候，你錯過了

201
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:56,040
So please wake up so we can do it right.
請你醒來，好好做完它

202
00:15:57,450 --> 00:16:00,010
Okay. Okay. I'm ready.
好，好，我準備好了

203
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:02,310
-Come on, big fella. -Okay.
-來，大哥 -好

204
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:04,580
-Give me the good stuff. -Yeah.
-好好表現一番 -是啊

205
00:16:05,730 --> 00:16:09,390
No, no, no. Don't fall asleep.
不，不，不，不要睡覺

206
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:13,760
Okay, I'm going to make you some coffee.
我要替你煮咖啡

207
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:20,040
Well, I probably won't spill coffee grounds all over the kitchen floor.
我大概不會把咖啡粉灑了一地

208
00:16:20,270 --> 00:16:21,900
Okay, I'm up. I'm up.
好吧，我起來了，我起來了

209
00:16:25,210 --> 00:16:28,380
Hi. I got you some coffee to..
嘿，咖啡來了…

210
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:30,880
So you got anything for me?
你找到東西了沒？

211
00:16:31,090 --> 00:16:32,920
-Still no luck. -Oh, my God.
-還是沒有 -我的天

212
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:35,920
You checked your entire desk and all the drawers?
你有檢查過整個桌子 和所有的抽屜嗎？

213
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:38,610
-Want me to check again? -I wish you would.
-要我再找一次？ -請你再找一次

214
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:42,560
Well, no, it's not in there.
它沒有在這裡

215
00:16:43,300 --> 00:16:44,590
How about that drawer?
那個抽屜呢？

216
00:16:51,910 --> 00:16:55,900
Well, it's not out here. Any chance it could be in your office?
它不在這裡，有可能在你辦公室嗎？

217
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:03,810
I don't know.
我不知道

218
00:17:05,120 --> 00:17:06,710
I mean, let me check.
我找找看

219
00:17:15,730 --> 00:17:17,160
Any luck?
有嗎？

220
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:20,830
See you in my office for a minute?
請進來說話

221
00:17:23,770 --> 00:17:25,640
You found them!
你找到了！

222
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,630
I'm not even gonna gloat.
我不會偷笑

223
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:33,110
-I'm just really relieved it's.. -You put these on my desk.
-我很安慰整件事… -你放在我桌上的

224
00:17:33,310 --> 00:17:34,470
-I did not. -Oh, really?
-我沒有 -真的嗎？

225
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,550
So they left your bottom drawer...
它從你最下面的抽屜溜出來…

226
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:39,650
crawled across the floor, then jumped onto my desk?
爬過地板，跳到我桌上來？

227
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:42,620
How did you know they were in my bottom drawer?
你怎麼知道它在我最下面的抽屜？

228
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:49,430
I am so hot for you right now.
此刻你令我慾火焚身

229
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:06,140
Oh, my God! How did you get back here?
我的天！你怎麼回來的？

230
00:18:06,350 --> 00:18:08,140
Phoebe Buffay?
菲比布非？

231
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,320
Fire Alarm?
警報器？

232
00:18:17,490 --> 00:18:21,290
Oh, hi, Officer Fireman. Can I help you?
嗨，救火員先生，有什麼事嗎？

233
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:23,400
Your fire alarm was in the trash.
我們在垃圾桶發現你的警報器

234
00:18:23,730 --> 00:18:25,430
-That's not mine. -Yes, it is.
-不是我的 -是你的

235
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:26,590
How do you know?
你怎麼知道？ 

236
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:29,790
If you dump a fire alarm, don't use a blanket that says:
下次你丟掉警報器時 不要用寫著

237
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:32,970
"Property of Phoebe Buffay, not Monica."
「菲比布非財物 不是摩妮卡的」的毯子

238
00:18:33,970 --> 00:18:35,670
Do you have a search warrant?
你有搜索令嗎？

239
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:39,330
Because the last time I checked, this was still America.
我查過了，這裡還是美國

240
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:43,470
Please reattach it. It's illegal to disconnect them.
請把它裝回去，拆除它是違法的

241
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:47,750
Fine. But please, God, tell me how to stop it from going off?
好吧，拜託告訴我 怎樣才能讓它不叫？

242
00:18:47,990 --> 00:18:49,550
Press the reset button.
壓下重設的按鈕

243
00:18:49,760 --> 00:18:53,390
There's a reset button? Oh, thank you. Thank you.
有重設按鈕？謝謝，謝謝

244
00:18:53,630 --> 00:18:56,490
Oh. There's a reset button?
有重設按鈕？

245
00:18:56,730 --> 00:18:58,720
My God!
我的天！

246
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:01,230
Why didn't I see that?
我怎麼沒看到？

247
00:19:02,940 --> 00:19:05,530
Reset button. Reset button.
重設按鈕，重設按鈕

248
00:19:05,770 --> 00:19:08,940
Where is there a reset button? Oh, here it is! Oh!
重設按鈕在哪裡？ 哦，在這兒！喔！

249
00:19:27,590 --> 00:19:30,220
-Okay, you have a good grip? -Yeah.
-你抓好了嗎？ -好了

250
00:19:30,430 --> 00:19:33,260
I'm gonna start to climb down you now.
我要開始爬過你了

251
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:38,240
-All right, just hurry up. -Okay.
-好，快一點 -好

252
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:41,870
Now, should I climb down your front so we're face to face...
我應該面向你爬下來 所以我們面對面的…

253
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:45,570
or should I climb down your back so we're...
還是應該背對你爬下來…

254
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:47,540
butt to face?
然後屁股對著臉？

255
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:51,250
-Face to face. -I like face to face.
-面對面 -我喜歡面對面

256
00:19:51,990 --> 00:19:54,950
-Okay, here I come. -All right.
-我來了 -好

257
00:19:58,190 --> 00:20:00,920
Oh, my.. How much do you weigh, Ross?
我的天…羅斯，你多重？

258
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:07,060
I prefer not to answer. I'm still carrying a little holiday weight.
我不想回答，過節時胖的還沒瘦下去

259
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:16,910
When we talked about face to face...
我們說要面對面時…

260
00:20:17,110 --> 00:20:19,980
I don't think we thought it all the way through.
我想我們沒有想清楚

261
00:20:20,610 --> 00:20:24,450
-What do you want me to do? -Just shimmy down me and drop.
-你要我怎麼辦？ -從我身上滑下，跳下去

262
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,250
-Hi. -Hi.
-嘿 -嘿

263
00:20:32,990 --> 00:20:36,620
You know, maybe I should hang,  and you should climb down me.
也許我該吊著，你爬過我下去

264
00:20:36,830 --> 00:20:40,430
Yeah? Maybe we should talk about that for a little while!
是嗎？也許我們應該多討論一下！

265
00:20:41,870 --> 00:20:45,530
-It still looks pretty far. -It's not that far. Just drop.
-看起來還好遠 -沒有那麼遠，跳就是了

266
00:20:45,770 --> 00:20:47,500
Do not rush me!
不要催我！

267
00:20:55,520 --> 00:21:00,280
My pants are starting to come down, and I'm not wearing any underwear.
我的褲子開始下滑，我沒穿內褲

268
00:21:05,860 --> 00:21:08,350
My ankle! I really hurt my ankle!
我的腳踝！我傷到我的腳踝！

269
00:21:08,630 --> 00:21:12,120
I think I twisted it when.. A quarter!
我想我扭到了…二十五分！

270
00:21:18,340 --> 00:21:20,770
That really was some of your best work.
真的是你的最佳表現

271
00:21:20,970 --> 00:21:22,640
I told you.
我說了嘛

272
00:21:26,310 --> 00:21:27,470
I can't believe it.
真不能相信

273
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:31,810
I've only got two hours until I call in sick for work.
只剩兩小時我就要打電話請假

274
00:21:32,290 --> 00:21:34,310
I have to be up in seven minutes.
我7分鐘後就要起床

275
00:21:35,360 --> 00:21:39,550
Well, you're not gonna believe this, but if you have seven minutes...
你不會相信的，如果你還有7分鐘…

276
00:21:40,260 --> 00:21:41,820
Really?
真的？

277
00:21:42,330 --> 00:21:43,760
You want to?
你想要？

278
00:21:43,960 --> 00:21:47,420
You get the vacuum cleaner. I'll get the furniture polish.
你去拿吸塵器，我拿傢俱打亮劑

279
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


280
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
